%%{init: {'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '22px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Quan tri vien
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(Next.js)
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(VouchersController + VouchersService)
    participant Vouchers as MongoDB (vouchers)

    Note over Admin,Vouchers: UPDATE — PATCH /vouchers/:id (chi Admin)
    Admin->>FE: Sua thong tin voucher
    FE->>BE: PATCH /vouchers/:id { discountValue, expiredAt, usageLimit, ... }
    BE->>Vouchers: findOne({ _id: id, deletedAt: null })

    alt Voucher khong ton tai hoac da bi xoa
        Vouchers-->>BE: null
        BE-->>FE: 404 Voucher khong ton tai
        FE-->>Admin: Hien thi loi
    else Tim thay
        Vouchers-->>BE: voucher document
        BE->>BE: Object.assign(voucher, updateData)
        Note over BE: Neu expiredAt duoc truyen vao —<br/>chuyen tu ISO string sang Date object truoc khi luu
        BE->>Vouchers: voucher.save()
        Vouchers-->>BE: voucher da cap nhat
        BE-->>FE: 200 { voucher }
        FE-->>Admin: Cap nhat thanh cong
    end
